startscums -- for both these classes, it is people chasing a particular
spellbook.

> - Wizards are the least successul class (followed closely by Monks),
>    even if ignoring all the quit's (see the second percentage number)

Yup.  And this is because newbies play Wizards and die very, very
frequently.  Look at how many Wizards are played even WITHOUT the quits;
