> - Cavemen and Knights are the most successful classes

I repeat:  Do you think this is because Caveman and Knight are the
easiest classes, or because a noticeably larger proportion of skilled
players play Cavemen and Knights, as opposed to newbies?

Those two classes are the least played, according to your numbers.
Newbies die a lot and would generate a lot of games-played.

If you are going to claim that Wizard is a hard class because it's the
least successful on NAO, then you should also claim that Caveman and
Knight are the easiest classes... which we all know isn't true.

